  "title": "Add error handling for gcry_md_open.",
  "description": "It seems wise to pay attention if the library says that (for whatever reason)\nit could not prepare a message digest context for us.  gcry_md_open returns 0\nupon success, or some nonzero value if it fails.\n\nAlso, propagate that error handling up where necessary.\n\nBased substantially upon the patch Zhouyang provided in #14475, but with a few\nof my own extensions.\n\nFixes #14475.",
