      "title": "Add error handling for gcry_md_open.",
      "message": "Add error handling for gcry_md_open.\n\nIt seems wise to pay attention if the library says that (for whatever reason)\nit could not prepare a message digest context for us.  gcry_md_open returns 0\nupon success, or some nonzero value if it fails.\n\nAlso, propagate that error handling up where necessary.\n\nBased substantially upon the patch Zhouyang provided in #14475, but with a few\nof my own extensions.\n\nFixes #14475.\n",
      "author_name": "Darius Davis",
      "author_email": "darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au",
      "authored_date": "2024-04-16T14:55:04.000+10:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2024-05-02T11:07:34.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/41e49284817645e2af287b8b1b97382812db6815"
    }
